I would suggest to remove the classes `HiddenClassSupportBeforeJDK15` and `HiddenClassFeatureBeforeJDK15` and to add the following method instead:
```
@Fold
public static boolean isAvailable() {
    return ImageSingletons.contains(HiddenClassSupport.class);
